SUMMARY:55th Child Neurology Society Annual Meeting
DESCRIPTION:The Child Neurology Society holds its 55th annual meeting in 
 Montreal\, Quebec\, with scientific sessions and abstract presentations 
 in pediatric neurology. A resident seminar on epilepsy precedes the main
  program on October 12 and 13.\n\nDeadlines\nAbstract submission: 2026-0
 2-01\nAbstract withdrawal deadline: 2026-07-31\nEncore abstract eligibil
 ity cutoff: 2026-05-03\n\nhttps://www.childneurologysociety.org/colleagu
 es/network/cns-annual-meeting/
LOCATION:Montreal\, Quebec\, CA\, Palais des congres de Montreal
URL:https://www.childneurologysociety.org/colleagues/network/cns-annual-m
 eeting/
